527
00:29:04,960 --> 00:29:07,780
大约一万亿个一万亿分之一英寸
about a trillionth of a trillionth of an inch.

528
00:29:07,900 --> 00:29:11,720
弗里曼：在Paul的模型中，我们宇宙中的每件事物
ln Paul's model, everything in our Universe

