能量会转换
energy would be converted

542
00:29:43,970 --> 00:29:48,320
膜的动能转换成物质和辐射
from the energy of motion of the branes into matter and radiation

543
00:29:48,440 --> 00:29:50,390
结果，当它们再一次分开的时候
so that when they came apart again,

544
00:29:50,510 --> 00:29:53,200
它们会充满热的物质和辐射
they would be filled with hot matter and radiation,

545
00:29:53,310 --> 00:29:56,300
就像大爆炸之后我们得到的
just like what we'd get after a Big Bang.

546
00:29:56,410 --> 00:29:59,200
实际上，我们认识到这可能就是宇宙大爆炸
ln fact, we realized this could be the Big Bang.

547
00:29:59,310 --> 00:30:02,910
宇宙大爆炸，不是空间和时间的开始
The Big Bang, instead of being the beginning of space and time,

548
00:30:03,020 --> 00:30:04,710
可能实际上是一个碰撞
could actually be a collision.

549
00:30:04,820 --> 00:30:08,340
弗里曼：Paul相信这个异型宇宙
Paul believes that this alien universe

550
00:30:08,460 --> 00:30:11,650
