They call it dark matter.

563
00:30:53,670 --> 00:30:55,280
这种在别的膜世界中的物质
The matter that's on the other brane world,

564
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,400
从我们的角度
which from our vantage point

565
00:30:56,510 --> 00:30:58,560
好像是一种暗物质
