00:31:00,910 --> 00:31:05,870
弗里曼：在平行宇宙中暗物质 可能确实是物质吗？
Could dark matter actually be matter in a parallel world?

568
00:31:05,980 --> 00:31:08,570
Paul认为我们可以找到真相
Paul thinks we may find the truth

